README.md:34:**Keep `JUDGE_PREVIEW_ENABLED=false` until the deployment has been independently tested.** Production processing remains closed unless the flag is exactly `true`, `DEMO_MODE` is not enabled, all required configuration validates, and Redis is available. Authenticated processing requires a valid signed one-hour cookie and same-origin request. Password attempts, PDF uploads, deterministic audit calls, and Groq investigations have separate persistent limits. Uploading PDFs does not consume investigation credits; one call to `/api/investigate` reserves one credit before provider inference. Limits use atomic Redis Lua operations across serverless instances. Missing configuration, quota exhaustion, or Redis failure rejects access.
